# Pre-Edit Checklist (MANDATORY)

Before EVERY code edit, mentally verify:

## Widget Edits

- [ ] Am I creating a private `Widget _build*()` method? → **STOP** - Create separate widget file
- [ ] Am I creating a private `_show*()` or `_display*()` method? → **STOP** - Create separate widget file
- [ ] Is this view file getting >250 lines? → **STOP** - Extract widgets first

## Imports

- [ ] Am I using a relative import (`../`)? → **STOP** - Use `package:riverpod_template/...`

## Types

- [ ] Am I using `dynamic`? → **STOP** - Use specific type

## Logic Placement

- [ ] Am I adding business logic to a view? → **STOP** - Move to controller
- [ ] Am I adding API calls to a view? → **STOP** - Move to repository via controller

## Styling

- [ ] Am I hardcoding a color value? → **STOP** - Use theme / app colors
- [ ] Am I using raw spacing numbers? → **STOP** - Use consistent spacing constants

## Routes

- [ ] Am I using string literals for routes? → **STOP** - Use `AppRoute.xxx`

## Feedback (Snackbars / Toasts)

- [ ] Am I showing a snackbar or toast? → **STOP** - Use `SnackbarMixin` and `showInfoSnackbar(context, message)` (not `ScaffoldMessenger.of(context).showSnackBar`)

## Testing (After Edits)

- [ ] Did I modify a model in `lib/models/`? → **UPDATE** its test in `test/models/` and run tests
- [ ] Did I modify a repository in `lib/data/repositories/`? → **UPDATE** its test in `test/repositories/` and run tests
- [ ] Did I modify a controller? → **UPDATE** its test in `test/presentation/` and run tests
- [ ] Before committing → **RUN** `fvm flutter test` and ensure all tests pass

## If ANY check fails, fix BEFORE proceeding.
